  "solution": "Sắp xếp khối lượng các quả măng cụt ở lô A và lô B theo thứ tự không giảm, ta được\n\t\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"tex-table\"><tbody><tr><td>Lô A</td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>80</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>80</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>80</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>81</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>82</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>82</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>82</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>83</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>84</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>84</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>85</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>85</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>85</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>85</mn></semantics></math></td></tr><tr><td>Lô B</td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>78</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>80</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>80</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>80</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>81</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>82</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>82</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>82</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>83</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>84</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>84</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>85</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>86</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>87</mn></semantics></math></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n\t\t<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Đối với lô A, khối lượng cao nhất và thấp nhất tương ứng là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>85</mn></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>80</mn></semantics></math>. Do đó khoảng biến thiên của lô A là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>85</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Đối với lô B, khối lượng cao nhất và thấp nhất tương ứng là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>87</mn></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>78</mn></semantics></math>.<br>Do đó khoảng biến thiên của lô B là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>87</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>78</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Đối với lô A, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn><mi>A</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>81</mn><mo>,</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>A</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>85</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>Δ</mi><mi>Q</mi><mi>A</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>85</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>81</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Đối với lô B, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn><mi>B</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>,</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><msubsup><mi>Q</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>B</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>84</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>Δ</mi><mi>Q</mi><mi>B</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>84</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Khối lượng trung bình của cân nặng măng cụt lô A là\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mi>x</mi><mo accent=\"true\">¯</mo></mover><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>14</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>81</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>82</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>83</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>84</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>85</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>579</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tPhương sai của cân nặng măng cụt lô A là\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>14</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msup><mn>3.80</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>81</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3.82</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>83</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2.84</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>4.85</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mn>579</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>63</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tĐộ lệch chuẩn của măng cụt lô A là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>S</mi><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>≈</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>63</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>91</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t\t\tKhối lượng trung bình của cân nặng măng cụt lô B là\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mi>x</mi><mo accent=\"true\">¯</mo></mover><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>14</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>78</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3.80</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>81</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3.82</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>83</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2.84</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>85</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>86</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>87</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>577</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tPhương sai của cân nặng măng cụt lô B là\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>14</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msup><mn>78</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3.80</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>81</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3.82</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>83</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2.84</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>85</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>86</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>87</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mn>577</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tĐộ lệch chuẩn của măng cụt lô B là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>S</mi><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>≈</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo>≈</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>47</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Sử dụng khoảng biến thiên và độ lệch chuẩn ta đều thấy khối lượng măng cụt ở lô A đều hơn lô B.</li></ol>",
